<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.0.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/secureSoftwareAttestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reference to information assuring that the software is developed using security practices as defined by [NIST SP 800-218 Secure Software Development Framework (SSDF) Version 1.1](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/final) or [CISA Secure Software Development Attestation Form](https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/secure-software-development-attestation-form)."@en .
